{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06975","headline":"小山歌 · 万楚","name":"小山歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人说淮南有小山，淮王昔日此登仙。\n城中鸡犬皆飞去，山上坛场今宛然。\n世人贵身不贵寿，共笑华阳洞天口。\n不知金石变长年，谩在人间恋携手。\n君能举帆至淮南，家住盱眙余先谙。\n桐柏乱流平入海，茱萸一曲沸成潭。\n忆记来时魂悄悄，想见仙山衆峰小。\n今日长歌思不堪，君行爲报三青鸟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}